    "instruction": "I am organizing health assessment data for five team members and need to calculate their BMI metrics for our company wellness initiative. Could you please use the CDC BMI calculator to compute the BMI and categories for five individuals (Names: Alice, Bob, Charlie, Diana, Edward) with their respective heights and weights (Alice: 165 cm, 65 kg; Bob: 178 cm, 90 kg; Charlie: 170 cm, 70 kg; Diana: 158 cm, 75 kg; Edward: 185 cm, 85 kg), then save all their names, calculated BMI values, and BMI categories in the spreadsheet starting at A1 with appropriate headers?",
